    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

    <p>
      This Cookie Policy explains how ErsSoft Limited uses cookies and
      similar technologies on our website.
    </p>

    <p>
      Last updated: 6 October 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="card cookies-content">

    <h2>1. About This Cookie Policy</h2>

    <p>
      At ErsSoft Limited, we use cookies and similar technologies to help
      our website work correctly and to understand how people use our website.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our website gives information about ErsSoft, our services, our solutions
      and our professional Insights articles.
    </p>

    <p>
      We believe cookies should only be used when there is a clear reason
      for using them. We try to keep our use of cookies simple and limited.
    </p>

    <p>
      This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, why we use them and how
      you can control them.
    </p>


    <h2>2. What Is a Cookie?</h2>

    <p>
      A cookie is a small file that a website can save on your computer,
      mobile phone, tablet or other device.
    </p>

    <p>
      Cookies can help a website work correctly. They can also remember some
      choices and help website owners understand how people use their website.
    </p>

    <p>
      Session cookies are temporary and are normally removed when you close
      your browser. Persistent cookies can stay on your device for a certain
      period of time or until you delete them.
    </p>

    <p>
      Some cookies are placed by ErsSoft. Other cookies may be placed by
      services that we use on our website.
    </p>


    <h2>3. Why Does ErsSoft Use Cookies?</h2>

    <p>
      ErsSoft uses cookies and similar technologies for clear and practical
      reasons.
    </p>

    <p>They can help us understand:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>which pages people visit;</li>
      <li>which Insights articles people read;</li>
      <li>how often pages are viewed;</li>
      <li>how visitors move through our website;</li>
      <li>how visitors find our website;</li>
      <li>which content receives the most interest;</li>
      <li>the general area where visits come from;</li>
      <li>which devices and browsers visitors use; and</li>
      <li>whether there are technical problems with the website.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      This information helps us improve the ErsSoft website and create useful
      content for our visitors.
    </p>


    <h2>4. Essential Cookies</h2>

    <p>
      Some cookies or similar technologies are needed for our website or a
      service to work correctly.
    </p>

    <p>
      For example, they may help with website security, privacy choices,
      sessions or other important website functions.
    </p>

    <p>
      We do not use essential cookies for advertising.
    </p>

    <p>
      Where the law allows it, essential cookies may be used without your
      consent because they are needed for the website or a service that you
      request.
    </p>


    <h2>5. Analytics Cookies</h2>

    <p>
      ErsSoft uses Google Analytics 4 to help us understand how people use
      our website.
    </p>

    <p>Google Analytics may give us information about:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>pages that are viewed;</li>
      <li>the number of page views;</li>
      <li>how visitors move between pages;</li>
      <li>how visitors arrived at our website;</li>
      <li>the general geographic area of a visit;</li>
      <li>the type of device used; and</li>
      <li>the browser used to visit the website.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      For example, Google Analytics can help us understand whether an ErsSoft
      Insights article has been viewed and which content receives more interest.
    </p>

    <p>
      We use this information to understand the performance of our website
      and to make it better.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our purpose is to understand how our website is being used. We do not
      use Google Analytics with the intention of identifying individual visitors.
    </p>

    <p>
      Where your consent is required, analytics cookies will only be used
      after you accept them.
    </p>


    <h2>6. Functional Cookies</h2>

    <p>
      Some parts of our website may use functional cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      These cookies can help remember choices you make or help a website
      feature work correctly.
    </p>

    <p>
      We use these cookies to improve the website experience. We do not use
      them to create advertising profiles about our visitors.
    </p>


    <h2>7. What We Do Not Currently Use Cookies For</h2>

    <p>
      We also want to be clear about what ErsSoft does not currently use
      cookies for.
    </p>

    <p>On our main website, we do not currently use cookies to:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>create advertising profiles about our visitors;</li>
      <li>follow visitors across unrelated websites for advertising;</li>
      <li>sell information collected through cookies; or</li>
      <li>
        show remarketing advertisements based on visits to the ErsSoft website.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      If this changes in the future, we will update this Cookie Policy.
      We will also ask for consent where required by law.
    </p>


    <h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>

    <p>
      ErsSoft may use services provided by other companies to support our
      website.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our main website analytics service is currently Google Analytics 4.
    </p>

    <p>
      A third-party service may use cookies or similar technologies under
      its own privacy and cookie rules.
    </p>

    <p>
      We only use third-party services when they have a clear purpose for
      our website or services.
    </p>

    <p>
      Where consent is required, a non-essential third-party service should
      only be used after you give your consent.
    </p>


    <h2>9. Your Cookie Choices</h2>

    <p>
      We want you to have a clear choice about non-essential cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      When cookie choices are shown on our website, you can choose whether
      to accept or reject non-essential cookies, including analytics cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you reject optional analytics cookies, you can still visit the
      ErsSoft website, read about our services and read our Insights articles.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can also control cookies through your browser.
    </p>

    <p>Most browsers allow you to:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>see stored cookies;</li>
      <li>delete cookies;</li>
      <li>block cookies;</li>
      <li>block third-party cookies; and</li>
      <li>change your cookie settings.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      Please remember that blocking some essential technologies may affect
      how some website features work.
    </p>


    <h2>10. Our Approach to Website Analytics</h2>

    <p>
      Website analytics help ErsSoft understand how our website is performing.
    </p>

    <p>We use analytics to answer simple and useful questions:</p>

    <ul>
      <li>Are people finding our website?</li>
      <li>Which pages and Insights articles are useful to visitors?</li>
      <li>How are visitors finding ErsSoft?</li>
      <li>How can we improve our website?</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      We are interested in how our website and content perform. We do not use
      website analytics with the intention of finding out the identity of
      individual visitors.
    </p>

    <p>
      We believe website information should be collected for a clear reason
      and used responsibly.
    </p>


    <h2>11. Changes to This Cookie Policy</h2>

    <p>
      Our website and digital services may change over time.
    </p>

    <p>
      If we make an important change to the way we use cookies or similar
      technologies, we will update this Cookie Policy.
    </p>

    <p>
      The date at the top of this page shows when the policy was last updated.
    </p>


    <h2>12. Privacy</h2>

    <p>
      More information about how ErsSoft Limited collects, uses, stores and
      protects personal information is available in our
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>


    <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>

    <p>
      If you have questions about cookies, website analytics or privacy,
      please contact:
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>ErsSoft Limited</strong><br>
      International House, 12 Constance Street<br>
      London, United Kingdom, E16 2DQ<br>
      Email: info@erssoft.co.uk<br>
      Phone: +44 7518 630370
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

